// ============================================================================
// ShardScript flat C API
// ============================================================================
// Generated bindings for every public C++ entity in the ShardScript headers.
// Every entry point uses C linkage, validates its arguments and shields the
// ABI boundary from C++ exceptions.
// ============================================================================

